<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>My Blog</title>
    <style>
      @import url("https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Montserrat:ital,wght@0,100..900;1,100..900&family=Poppins:ital,wght@0,100;0,200;0,300;0,400;0,500;0,600;0,700;0,800;0,900;1,100;1,200;1,300;1,400;1,500;1,600;1,700;1,800;1,900&display=swap");
      @import url("https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Montserrat:ital,wght@0,100..900;1,100..900&family=Open+Sans:ital,wght@0,300..800;1,300..800&family=Raleway:ital,wght@0,100..900;1,100..900&display=swap");
      * {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }
      body,
      html {
        overflow-x: hidden;
      }
      ::-webkit-scrollbar {
        width: 7px;
      }
      ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
        background-color: grey;
        border-radius: 10px;
      }
      header .right ul li a:hover + .mouse-background {
        width: 45px;
        height: 45px;
      }
      body {
        font-family: "poppins", sans-serif;
      }
      .blurred {
        filter: blur(2px);
        transition: 0.3s ease-in-out filter;
      }
      header nav {
        background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252);
        color: rgb(0, 0, 0);
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        padding: 0px 100px;
        justify-content: space-between;
        height: 70px;
        box-shadow: rgba(17, 17, 26, 0.1) 0px 0px 16px;
        border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(212, 212, 212);
      }
      header nav .left {
        display: flex;
      }
      header nav .left img {
        width: 50px;
        height: 50px;
      }
      header nav .left .menu {
        display: none;
      }
      header nav .left .menu .bars {
        background-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);
        height: 2px;
        width: 35px;
        margin: 6px 0;
        transition: transform 0.4s ease-in-out;
      }
      header nav .right {
        display: flex;
        align-items: flex-end;
        justify-content: end;
      }
      header nav .right ul {
        display: flex;
        gap: 1.5rem;
      }
      header nav .right ul li {
        list-style: none;
      }
      header nav .right ul li a {
        text-decoration: none;
        color: rgb(0, 0, 0);
        transition: all 0.4s ease-in;
      }
      header nav .right ul li a::after {
        content: "";
        width: 0%;
        height: 1px;
        background-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);
        display: block;
        transition: 0.4s width ease-in-out;
      }
      header nav .right ul li a:hover::after {
        width: 90%;
      }
     
      .blog,.comments{
        padding: 30px 100px;
      }

      footer {
        background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252);
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        padding: 30px 100px;
        box-shadow: rgba(17, 17, 26, 0.1) 0px 0px 16px;
        border-top: 1px solid rgb(212, 212, 212);
        gap: 1.4rem;
      }
      footer .logo img {
        width: 50px;
        height: 50px;
      }
      footer .links ul {
        display: flex;
        gap: 1rem;
      }
      footer .links ul a {
        text-decoration: none;
        color: black;
      }
      footer .links ul li {
        list-style: none;
      }
      footer .links ul a::after {
        content: "";
        width: 0%;
        height: 1px;
        background-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);
        display: block;
        transition: 0.4s width ease-in-out;
      }
      footer .links ul a:hover::after {
        width: 90%;
      }
      footer .footer-text {
        width: 100%;
      }
      footer .footer-text p {
        text-align: center;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <header>
      <nav class="navbar">
        <div class="left">
          <div class="empty"></div>
          <h2><a href="http://localhost:1000" style="color:black; text-decoration: none;">Home</a></h2>
          <div class="menu">
            <div class="bars"></div>
            <div class="bars"></div>
            <div class="bars"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="right">
          <ul>
            <li><a href="http://localhost:1000/addBlog">Add Blog</a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </nav>
    </header>
    <div class="blog">
      <h2>Blog 1</h2>
      <p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur adipisicing elit. Sint impedit iure dignissimos? Eos possimus doloribus soluta. Ipsum quas aliquid officiis nisi omnis reprehenderit perferendis dolorem! Nam eos natus labore eligendi illo ab consequatur quibusdam iure enim explicabo ipsum adipisci doloremque, eveniet dicta possimus sequi, fuga tempora? Officiis culpa recusandae commodi accusamus, reprehenderit, atque nulla, provident libero nihil harum quae vitae voluptas est. Nisi libero odio, numquam consectetur maxime quas. Quaerat dolorem et nostrum nihil, porro ea, commodi blanditiis pariatur ducimus ipsa, eligendi quis? Omnis incidunt, atque animi saepe magnam eligendi qui harum laborum esse laboriosam quis sequi. Magnam, accusamus asperiores repellendus porro esse adipisci ex aperiam tempore, iusto eaque consequuntur doloribus amet culpa dolor quod. Dolores doloremque odit, dolor possimus iste natus ratione nisi cum totam expedita praesentium odio libero illum omnis mollitia eum, eaque blanditiis? Aliquam facilis deserunt ex. Ipsum voluptas similique rem laborum dolore, placeat libero quasi modi et hic qui aut error reprehenderit voluptate laudantium inventore vitae itaque esse harum, maiores sint explicabo aspernatur earum suscipit. Quis soluta sed aut architecto, est suscipit esse nemo ab, ducimus dignissimos ex. Modi repudiandae nostrum ducimus eum architecto quis dolorum optio cum minus voluptatem! Accusamus doloremque consequuntur odio dicta officiis ab beatae provident sint odit perspiciatis eaque possimus, sapiente, nemo quasi illo magni vitae rem aliquam dolor laboriosam saepe eos. Molestias saepe debitis fugiat, tempora laboriosam beatae sapiente distinctio voluptatem! Odit ullam quisquam et delectus cum! Obcaecati vitae placeat fugiat asperiores, corrupti eos dolorum quibusdam officia perferendis quod quis id tempore eveniet facilis accusantium aperiam quasi laudantium, delectus atque praesentium expedita quaerat. Necessitatibus harum voluptas error s